ss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"given"},{"surface":"இப்பொருட்கு","parts":[{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"this"},{"text":"பொருட்கு","lemma":"பொருள்","gloss":"wealth-dative"}],"gloss":"for this wealth"},{"surface":"யானோர்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"I am one"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாணிகப்","parts":[{"text":"வாணிகப்","lemma":"வாணிகம்","gloss":"trade"}],"gloss":"commercial"},{"surface":"பரிசிலன்","parts":[{"text":"பரிசில்","lemma":"பரிசில்","gloss":"gift"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"person"}],"gloss":"seeker of gifts"},{"surface":"அல்லேன்","parts":[{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"ஏன்","lemma":"ஏன்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I am not"},{"surface":"பேணித்","parts":[{"text":"பேணித்","lemma":"பேணு","gloss":"cherishing"}],"gloss":"cherishing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தினை","parts":[{"text":"தினை","lemma":"தினை","gloss":"millet"}],"gloss":"millet"},{"surface":"அனைத்து","parts":[{"text":"அனைத்து","lemma":"அனைத்து","gloss":"measure"}],"gloss":"as small as"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"ஆயினும்","gloss":"even if it is"}],"gloss":"even if it is"},{"surface":"இனிதுஅவர்","parts":[{"text":"இனிது","lemma":"இனிது","gloss":"sweet"},{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"sweet is his"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துணை","parts":[{"text":"துணை","lemma":"துணை","gloss":"measure"}],"gloss":"measure"},{"surface":"அளவு","parts":[{"text":"அளவு","lemma":"அளவு","gloss":"measure"}],"gloss":"measure"},{"surface":"அறிந்து","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"know"},{"text":"ந்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"nasal"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past"},{"text":"உ","lemma":"உ","gloss":"verbal participle"}],"gloss":"knowing"},{"surface":"நல்கினர்","parts":[{"text":"நல்கு","lemma":"நல்கு","gloss":"give"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"past"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"they"}],"gloss":"they gave"},{"surface":"விடினே","parts":[{"text":"விடின்","lemma":"விடின்","gloss":"if give"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"clitic"}],"gloss":"if indeed they give"}]}],"literal":"Hills and mountains, many behind to be left behind / I came, gifts I received to go, saying / stood me valuing, having graced, 'this having taken / in this manner may go he', saying, me / how did he know, the mighty protector? / Without seeing, for this wealth given, I am one / commercial seeker of gifts am not; cherishing / millet as small as even if it is, sweet is his / measure of friendship knowing, if indeed they give.","translation":"Leaving many hills and mountains behind, I came to receive gifts and depart. But the mighty protector, without even seeing me, sent word saying, 'Take this and go.' How could he know me so? I am no commercial seeker of gifts who trades for wealth. Even if it is as tiny as a millet seed, a gift is sweet only when given with love, by those who truly understand the measure of our friendship.","modern":"பல குன்றுகளையும் மலைகளையும் பின்னே விட்டுவிட்டு, நான் பரிசில் பெற்றுச் செல்வதற்காக வந்தேன். ஆனால், தாங்குவதற்கு அரிய வலிமை கொண்ட காவலனாகிய அதியமான், என்னை நேரில் காணாமலேயே, 'இதைப் பெற்றுக்கொண்டு இங்கிருந்து போகட்டும்' என்று கூறிப் பரிசிலை அனுப்பியிருக்கிறான். அவன் என்னை எவ்வாறு அறிந்து கொண்டான்? நேரில் காணாமல் கொடுத்த இந்தப் பொருளைப் பெறுவதற்கு நான் ஒன்றும் வியாபாரப் பரிசிலன் அல்லன். அன்போடு போற்றி, தினை அளவு மிகச் சிறியதாக இருந்தாலும், கொடுப்பவர் நமது நட்பின் அளவை அறிந்து கொடுத்தால் அதுவே நமக்கு மிகவும் இனிமையானது.","explanation":"The poet Peruñcittiraṉār is speaking about King Atiyamāṉ Neṭumāṉ Añci. The poet visited the king seeking patronage, but the king sent him gifts through intermediaries without granting an audience. The poet refuses the gifts, stating that he is not a merchant trading poems for wealth. He values personal connection and mutual respect far above material riches. The key phrase 'வாணிகப் பரிசிலன்' (commercial seeker of gifts) highlights the poet's self-respect, while 'துணை அளவு' (measure of friendship) emphasizes that true patronage is based on mutual understanding, not mere charity.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.6],[0.6,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.9],[2.9,3.2],[3.2,4.0],[4.0,4.3],[4.3,4.4],[4.4,5.6],[5.6,6.3],[6.3,6.5],[6.67,7.0],[7.0,7.4],[7.49,8.0],[8.0,8.32],[8.4,8.6],[8.6,8.8],[8.8,9.1],[9.1,9.53],[9.53,9.53],[9.53,10.4],[10.4,11.8],[11.8,12.8],[12.8,12.8],[12.8,13.5],[13.5,14.1],[14.1,15.2],[15.2,15.3],[15.3,15.7],[15.7,16.1],[16.1,16.1],[16.1,17.5],[17.5,17.9],[17.9,18.5],[19.16,19.56],[19.56,19.86],[19.86,20.16],[20.16,20.86],[20.86,20.96]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.6],[1.6,1.9],[1.9,3.5],[3.5,3.8],[4.4,4.47],[4.47,4.7],[4.7,5.5],[5.5,6.42],[6.6,7.2],[7.2,7.6],[7.7,7.9],[7.9,8.3],[8.43,9.2],[9.2,9.6],[9.6,9.8],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,11.85],[11.85,12.3],[12.3,13.0],[13.0,13.1],[13.1,14.6],[14.6,14.6],[14.6,15.52],[15.7,16.2],[16.2,17.8],[17.8,17.9],[17.9,18.4],[18.4,18.9],[18.9,18.9],[18.9,20.7],[20.7,21.2],[21.2,21.9],[22.6,23.1],[23.1,23.4],[23.4,23.8],[23.8,24.5],[24.5,24.5]]}}